1
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:13,420
(This story is entirely fictional)

2
00:00:13,599 --> 00:00:15,199
Thanks for today.

3
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:18,399
Tianyi is waiting out there.

4
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,280
He'll take you home.

5
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,240
(Based on the novel
Doctor Qin: Executer)

6
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,039
Tianyi.

7
00:00:36,679 --> 00:00:37,759
Your wife's something else.

8
00:00:39,679 --> 00:00:41,000
She's got more backbone than you.

9
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,280
I'm glad you're satisfied.

10
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:47,719
As long as you're satisfied.

11
00:01:09,159 --> 00:01:09,959
Why are you crying?

12
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,840
You should be happy.

13
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,640
No.

14
00:01:14,599 --> 00:01:16,359
You should be proud.

15
00:01:18,159 --> 00:01:19,519
How much humiliation

16
00:01:19,519 --> 00:01:21,239
do I have to endure for this money?

17
00:01:22,879 --> 00:01:23,799
See for yourself!

18
00:01:27,079 --> 00:01:27,920
Honey.

19
00:01:29,239 --> 00:01:30,599
I'm proud of you.

20
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:34,439
You're the pride of our family!

21
00:01:36,799 --> 00:01:38,040
Le Tianyi,

22
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,159
all you've learned

23
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:44,680
is how to be someone's dog.

24
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,640
But you forgot one thing.

25
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:49,680
However hard a dog wags its tail,

26
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:52,599
it can never earn human dignity.

27
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,239
This is dignity.

28
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,879
This is dignity.

29
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:00,920
You feel wronged?

30
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,439
I play the dog for others out there.

31
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:06,239
Do you think I like it?

32
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,080
I feel good about it?

33
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,240
What for?

34
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,000
Isn't it for this family?

35
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:12,879
Isn't it for you,

36
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:14,080
for Niu?

37
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:16,560
Everything you earn

38
00:02:16,719 --> 00:02:18,919
is filthy enough to disgust me.

39
00:02:20,199 --> 00:02:21,000
Honey.

40
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:22,520
Honey!

41
00:02:23,039 --> 00:02:24,759
What's the big deal

42
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:25,960
if you sacrifice a little?

43
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,439
If you won't help me,

44
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,479
who else will?

45
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:35,879
I want to rise above all!

46
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,560
I want dignity!

47
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:40,120
Let alone you,

48
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,639
for this cash,

49
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:44,680
I'd even sell myself if I had to!

50
00:02:49,159 --> 00:02:50,960
This is dignity.

51
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:55,980
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 7=

52
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:00,800
Wang Xuan,
walk us through how you did it.

53
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,960
I used a towel soaked in ether.

54
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:13,599
I'll tell you everything I know,

55
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:14,840
every last detail...

56
00:03:19,919 --> 00:03:21,360
He struggled a few times,

57
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:24,199
then stopped moving.

58
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:25,759
And then?

59
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:26,840
How did you get

60
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,199
a 75-kilogram man

61
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:30,240
from the car into the van?

62
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,240
I'm very strong.

63
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:33,960
I dragged him.

64
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,639
Yes, I dragged him.

65
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,120
There were no drag marks at the scene.

66
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,039
I carried him.

67
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,159
Did you drag him or carry him?

68
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:41,960
I was too nervous.

69
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,599
I honestly can't remember.

70
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:45,919
But I did get him into the van.

71
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:46,960
Where did you get the van?

72
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:47,800
I stole it.

73
00:03:49,879 --> 00:03:50,800
Where did you steal it?

74
00:03:50,879 --> 00:03:51,800
How did you steal it?

75
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,400
How did you start it without a key?

76
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,400
Where's the van now?

77
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,199
I did it!

78
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:56,439
I did all of it!

79
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,719
I hated him.

80
00:03:57,719 --> 00:03:59,039
I wanted him dead!

81
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:02,159
Before I threw him into that machine,

82
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,439
he was still alive.

83
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,680
I watched that machine

84
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:08,159
tear him apart bit by bit,

85
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:10,240
until he was in pieces!

86
00:04:10,599 --> 00:04:12,439
I did all of it!

87
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,800
Where's the machine
that shredded Le Tianyi?

88
00:04:23,279 --> 00:04:25,519
(Serve the People Well)
Wang Xuan was trying to save her family.

89
00:04:25,519 --> 00:04:27,120
Even if she seemed humble,

90
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,600
I could feel her strength.

91
00:04:28,959 --> 00:04:30,879
Le Tianyi was a lackey at work

92
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,120
(Serve the People Well)
and a tyrant at home,

93
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:34,639
exactly as his coworkers described him.

94
00:04:34,839 --> 00:04:35,800
As for her confession,

95
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:37,480
the emotional side feels genuine,

96
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:39,519
but the murder details don't add up.

97
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:40,240
She

98
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,439
couldn't have moved the body
all by herself.

99
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,279
It seems she's using

100
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:44,879
her real pain

101
00:04:45,079 --> 00:04:47,040
to cover up a fake murder story.

102
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,600
Are you saying

103
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:51,839
she's taking the fall for someone else?

104
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:53,839
What's the point of thinking about it?

105
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,879
We still need solid evidence.

106
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:57,480
Zhang Xiaodong

107
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:59,079
is no good, either.

108
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,920
Both cases

109
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:02,839
are somehow connected to him.

110
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:05,720
But there's no direct evidence
linking him to either.

111
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,519
Every time a crime happened,

112
00:05:07,519 --> 00:05:09,040
he had a perfect alibi.

113
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,600
If he's connected to the cases,

114
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,279
he'll slip up sooner or later.

115
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:15,959
Wait.

116
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,079
You said this is Niu's grandma?

117
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,279
Yes. Why?

118
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:26,560
No.

119
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:28,240
She's not.

120
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,160
Come on.

121
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,519
Let's pick Niu up from school.

122
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,600
(Longfan No. 6 Kindergarten)

123
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,279
Auntie.

124
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:55,439
(Target spotted.)

125
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:59,240
The target has picked up Niu.

126
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,319
Can you see her face?

127
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,480
No, I can't.

128
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,160
Follow her. Don't alert her.

129
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:05,959
We'll move in once she's far enough.

130
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:24,160
Qin Ming.

131
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,519
Keke.

132
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,920
Why are you following me?

133
00:06:27,079 --> 00:06:29,079
Is this work-related or personal?

134
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:30,439
So it really is you.

135
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,399
That look on your face says

136
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,000
this is no coincidence.

137
00:06:36,199 --> 00:06:37,439
Do you find it strange

138
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,199
that you keep

139
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,480
running into me?

140
00:06:42,639 --> 00:06:44,000
Why are you picking up Niu?

141
00:06:44,879 --> 00:06:46,160
Ms. Song asked me to.

142
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:47,240
You know Wang Xuan?

143
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:48,240
No.

144
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,839
I've heard about her from Ms. Song.

145
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,399
She's one of her students.

146
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:52,800
She married an animal.

147
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,680
Are you on a mission?

148
00:06:58,199 --> 00:06:59,839
Am I getting in your way?

149
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:00,959
No.

150
00:07:01,199 --> 00:07:02,000
I'm just

151
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:03,879
confused.

152
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,279
It's not confusing.

153
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:07,000
I'm Ms. Song's daughter now.

154
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:11,000
My mom asked me to pick up
her student's daughter.

155
00:07:11,639 --> 00:07:12,600
What's wrong with that?

156
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,279
I'm taking Niu home.

157
00:07:17,439 --> 00:07:18,199
What about you?

158
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,160
Still going the same way?

159
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:22,120
I'll take you home.

160
00:07:29,079 --> 00:07:30,639
Keke's cooking is great.

161
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,480
She's a better cook than me.

162
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,839
Ms. Song,

163
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:37,800
about Niu...

164
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:42,079
Wang Xuan's had a hard life.

165
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:45,360
Now she's in trouble,
and her child's left alone.

166
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,040
She's my student, after all.

167
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,480
I should help her.

168
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:53,839
Mom!

169
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,279
Niu fainted again!

170
00:08:06,959 --> 00:08:08,680
Visual pathway impairment and ataxia.

171
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:10,360
She needs a full examination

172
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,399
at the hospital right now.

173
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,199
She's been examined.

174
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:15,839
There's a tumor in her brain.

175
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,800
It was diagnosed a few days ago.

176
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,639
She's scheduled
for surgery in a few days.

177
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:25,040
Niu...

178
00:08:25,879 --> 00:08:26,680
It's okay.

179
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,639
It's okay.

180
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:31,199
Our Niu is the bravest girl.

181
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,440
Don't cry.

182
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,840
Don't be scared.

183
00:08:36,879 --> 00:08:38,120
Don't be scared.

184
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:57,919
Ms. Wang.

185
00:08:59,159 --> 00:08:59,960
Dr. Liu.

186
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:01,759
The results are out.

187
00:09:04,679 --> 00:09:06,600
I'm sure you can read the scan yourself.

188
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:08,200
I'm afraid things don't look good.

189
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:10,200
She needs surgery ASAP.

190
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:12,240
Get her dad to raise the money.

191
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,840
It's going to cost a lot.

192
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:31,879
Please,

193
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:34,159
save our daughter.

194
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,519
She's not my daughter.

195
00:09:38,279 --> 00:09:38,759
Tianyi,

196
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:41,159
before we got married,

197
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:43,120
you promised you'd take care of us.

198
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,960
How did we end up like this?

199
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,840
You forgot it?

200
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:57,080
Why don't you sleep
with Zhang Xiaodong again?

201
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,919
I'm sure he'll pay you.

202
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:09,680
♪Dark echoes twist
through a world of lies♪

203
00:10:12,053 --> 00:10:17,610
♪Hidden wounds sleep
beneath frozen eyes♪

204
00:10:19,133 --> 00:10:24,860
♪Truth is locked behind the walls♪

205
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:28,660
♪I reach out to find you♪

206
00:10:29,613 --> 00:10:34,093
♪Lost in the depths of the haze♪

207
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:39,010
♪You smile as you hide your heart away♪

208
00:10:39,746 --> 00:10:42,770
♪Our souls drift farther apart♪

209
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,360
Suspect Wang Xuan

210
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:46,159
(Emergency Center)
attempted suicide in the holding cell.

211
00:10:46,279 --> 00:10:48,039
We restrained her immediately

212
00:10:48,039 --> 00:10:49,559
and rushed her to the hospital.

213
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:50,240
Qin.

214
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,120
How is she?

215
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:51,960
Still in critical care.

216
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,879
Wang Xuan must be doing this

217
00:10:55,879 --> 00:10:57,080
to protect the person behind it,

218
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:59,120
or to end her own suffering.

219
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,559
She was so determined.

220
00:11:02,639 --> 00:11:03,519
The person behind it

221
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,120
must have offered her something

222
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,399
she couldn't refuse.

223
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:07,919
For example,

224
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,759
keeping Niu alive.

225
00:11:09,810 --> 00:11:11,026
(Surgery in Progress)

226
00:11:12,386 --> 00:11:13,670
(Surgical Area. Staff Only)

227
00:11:13,679 --> 00:11:14,519
How is she?

228
00:11:15,759 --> 00:11:17,639
The patient's out of danger now.

229
00:11:17,639 --> 00:11:18,559
But there's something

230
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:20,120
I need to tell you.

231
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:22,519
Her daughter's surgery was expensive.

232
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:24,159
They couldn't raise the money.

233
00:11:24,639 --> 00:11:26,799
The hospital did waive some of the fees,

234
00:11:26,799 --> 00:11:28,200
but it barely made a dent.

235
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:29,519
Until two days ago,

236
00:11:29,639 --> 00:11:31,200
the surgery was paid in full.

237
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,200
Paid in full?

238
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:32,960
Who paid it?

239
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:33,919
Wang Xuan herself.

240
00:11:34,279 --> 00:11:35,320
In cash.

241
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:36,919
I found it strange.

242
00:11:37,039 --> 00:11:38,039
Who still uses cash

243
00:11:38,039 --> 00:11:39,519
these days?

244
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,039
Two days ago?

245
00:11:43,279 --> 00:11:44,159
Wasn't that the day

246
00:11:44,879 --> 00:11:46,159
Le Tianyi disappeared?

247
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,519
We conducted a second thorough screening

248
00:11:50,519 --> 00:11:52,320
of the pig feed at the Zhou residence

249
00:11:52,559 --> 00:11:53,919
and found some fabric fragments.

250
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:55,679
(Evidence Bag)
We also extracted some substances.

251
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,799
I can't see anything.

252
00:12:04,679 --> 00:12:05,559
Fluorescent powder.

253
00:12:05,679 --> 00:12:06,519
Fluorescent powder?

254
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,960
It's not just fluorescent powder.

255
00:12:09,039 --> 00:12:10,480
After microscopic examination

256
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,679
and X-ray fluorescence spectroscopy,

257
00:12:12,919 --> 00:12:14,759
the particles
were extremely fine and highly pure.

258
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:15,960
More importantly,

259
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:18,519
they contain rare earth elements
like yttrium and europium

260
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,720
with a highly unusual composition.

261
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,879
This isn't the cheap fluorescent powder

262
00:12:21,879 --> 00:12:24,000
used in ordinary industrial products
or toys.

263
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:26,080
This substance would never appear

264
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,759
in the feed production process.

265
00:12:27,759 --> 00:12:29,120
Neither Wang Xuan nor Le Tianyi

266
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,919
had any social
or professional connection

267
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,279
that could've exposed them

268
00:12:32,279 --> 00:12:33,759
to this kind of specialized chemical.

269
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:34,559
I remember

270
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,600
trace amounts of fluorescent material

271
00:12:37,039 --> 00:12:38,679
were also found
under Su Shi's fingernails.

272
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:44,720
They match perfectly
in spectral and morphological features.

273
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:46,559
They're from the same source.

274
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:51,399
The two victims are connected

275
00:12:51,399 --> 00:12:53,559
by this rare fluorescent powder

276
00:12:53,559 --> 00:12:55,200
with its unique chemical signature.

277
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,080
This can't be accidental contamination.

278
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,159
A powder that only shows up

279
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:00,919
under UV light

280
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:03,080
appeared where it shouldn't have.

281
00:13:03,679 --> 00:13:05,320
That means

282
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:07,000
there's a specific environment

283
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:09,000
where UV light is needed

284
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,360
to reveal the powder.

285
00:13:10,679 --> 00:13:11,519
Exactly.

286
00:13:11,519 --> 00:13:12,360
(Zhang Xiaodong; Fluorescent Powder)
Overall,

287
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:13,679
Wang Xuan received the cash

288
00:13:13,679 --> 00:13:15,279
and took the fall

289
00:13:15,279 --> 00:13:16,639
to save her daughter.

290
00:13:16,639 --> 00:13:18,039
And the Executer behind it all

291
00:13:18,039 --> 00:13:20,080
was the true mastermind.

292
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,879
Putting the Su Shi case

293
00:13:21,879 --> 00:13:23,039
and the Le Tianyi case together,

294
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:24,600
they share a common location

295
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:26,919
(Fluorescent Powder)
where this mysterious powder came from.

296
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:29,399
The suspect was carrying out

297
00:13:29,399 --> 00:13:30,879
a ritualistic reckoning.

298
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:31,960
This powder

299
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,399
may point us in the right direction.

300
00:13:33,399 --> 00:13:35,519
(Fluorescent Powder)
We compared their communication records

301
00:13:35,519 --> 00:13:37,720
and found a frequent point of overlap,

302
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,200
the Fengshan area
in the west of the city.

303
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:41,919
They both frequently visited here.

304
00:13:41,919 --> 00:13:43,240
Their signals overlapped

305
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:45,080
and finally vanished
in an abandoned area

306
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:47,279
(Southern Foot of Fengshan)
at the southern foot of Fengshan.

307
00:14:03,919 --> 00:14:04,720
Ou Wen.

308
00:14:04,919 --> 00:14:05,720
Wang Xuan.

309
00:14:06,799 --> 00:14:07,720
What's wrong?

310
00:14:08,799 --> 00:14:09,600
Wang Xuan?

311
00:14:11,039 --> 00:14:12,200
What are you trying to say?

312
00:14:13,399 --> 00:14:14,240
Chen, your phone.

313
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:15,120
Give her your phone.

314
00:14:22,100 --> 00:14:25,453
(Feng)

315
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,559
The secret room, west district,

316
00:14:36,799 --> 00:14:37,600
Fengshan Villas.

317
00:14:44,039 --> 00:14:44,919
Officers,

318
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,840
may I ask what this is about?

319
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,399
We're conducting
a legal investigation here.

320
00:14:48,399 --> 00:14:49,320
(Search Warrant)
Open the gate.

321
00:14:50,679 --> 00:14:52,080
Mr. Zhang is on a business trip.

322
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:53,000
He instructed us

323
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:53,919
that while he's away,

324
00:14:53,919 --> 00:14:55,519
no one is allowed into the villa.

325
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:57,639
Could you come back when he returns?

326
00:14:57,639 --> 00:14:59,159
Did he say where he was going?

327
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,519
Well...

328
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:02,480
We don't dare ask
about his personal affairs.

329
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,600
And we shouldn't, anyway.

330
00:15:04,039 --> 00:15:06,080
Why don't you come back in a few days?

331
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,960
We're investigating a criminal case.

332
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:09,399
Please open the gate immediately,

333
00:15:09,399 --> 00:15:11,600
or we'll take necessary legal action.

334
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,320
Ou Wen,

335
00:15:28,519 --> 00:15:29,320
notify all departments

336
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,519
and track Zhang Xiaodong's whereabouts.

337
00:15:30,519 --> 00:15:31,679
Don't let him flee.

338
00:15:31,679 --> 00:15:32,440
Understood.

339
00:15:33,559 --> 00:15:34,679
Where's Zhang Xiaodong's driver?

340
00:15:35,279 --> 00:15:36,960
He's in the staff dorm
in the north district.

341
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:38,480
I'll ask him to come over.

342
00:15:43,879 --> 00:15:45,000
Come to the villa.

343
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:46,759
Okay.

344
00:15:50,279 --> 00:15:51,960
Zhang Xiaodong only has
one daughter, right?

345
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:52,600
Yes.

346
00:15:52,679 --> 00:15:53,879
This is her photo.

347
00:15:53,879 --> 00:15:55,159
She's studying abroad.

348
00:16:01,279 --> 00:16:03,080
Mr. Han,
Zhang Xiaodong's driver is here.

349
00:16:04,279 --> 00:16:05,480
You're Zhang Xiaodong's driver?

350
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,320
Yes.

351
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:08,080
Where is Zhang Xiaodong?

352
00:16:08,679 --> 00:16:09,600
He called me that day

353
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:10,759
for the car keys.

354
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:12,039
Then he drove off himself.

355
00:16:12,039 --> 00:16:13,399
Does he usually drive himself?

356
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:14,320
Rarely.

357
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:15,240
Unless...

358
00:16:15,399 --> 00:16:16,200
Unless what?

359
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,320
When he has a private date

360
00:16:18,759 --> 00:16:20,120
and doesn't want me around.

361
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,759
Didn't you say he was away on business?

362
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:27,679
Yes.

363
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:29,039
Mr. Zhang later sent me a message too,

364
00:16:29,039 --> 00:16:30,120
saying he was away on business.

365
00:16:35,620 --> 00:16:37,013
(No need to drive me for now.
I'm away on business.)

366
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:38,879
Does Zhang Xiaodong usually live here?

367
00:16:38,879 --> 00:16:39,519
Yes.

368
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:42,279
This is basically where

369
00:16:42,279 --> 00:16:43,320
Mr. Zhang lives and works.

370
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,720
Take us to the secret room
in the west district.

371
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:46,679
What secret room?

372
00:16:46,679 --> 00:16:48,159
The west district is where

373
00:16:48,159 --> 00:16:49,600
he keeps his personal collection.

374
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,840
I've never been there.

375
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,480
I don't think you get the situation.

376
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,480
Do you know the consequences

377
00:16:53,519 --> 00:16:54,679
of obstructing official duties?

378
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,120
Okay.

379
00:16:57,559 --> 00:16:58,480
I'll take you there.

380
00:17:35,279 --> 00:17:36,079
Mr. Han.

381
00:17:40,319 --> 00:17:41,119
Fluorescence.

382
00:17:41,279 --> 00:17:42,880
This isn't ordinary fluorescent powder.

383
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:45,359
Its color and brightness

384
00:17:45,359 --> 00:17:46,440
match what we found

385
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:48,720
on the fabric fragments

386
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:50,279
from Le Tianyi.

387
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:01,680
Han Liang,

388
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:04,160
this must be

389
00:18:04,519 --> 00:18:05,960
the "glowing room."

390
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:10,900
(Police)

391
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:20,520
(Public Security)

392
00:19:40,013 --> 00:19:42,060
(Xu Meng)

393
00:19:49,119 --> 00:19:49,920
Wang Xuan.

394
00:19:51,319 --> 00:19:52,839
Do you remember this dress?

395
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:11,759
(You go first.)

396
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,000
Ou Wen.

397
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:21,400
(Issue a warrant for Zhang Xiaodong.)

398
00:20:21,599 --> 00:20:23,079
(Find out where Xu Meng is now.)

399
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,200
(Understood.)

400
00:20:28,980 --> 00:20:30,453
(Retribution has come.
Every sin will be paid for.)

401
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:35,400
Mr. Qin, working overtime again?

402
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:36,359
There's something

403
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,200
I still can't figure out.

404
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:44,640
You mean the line
about the cage builder?

405
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:47,759
Could it mean

406
00:20:48,039 --> 00:20:50,480
that Su Shi imprisoned Su Tang?

407
00:20:51,559 --> 00:20:52,400
No.

408
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:53,759
It's more than that.

409
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:55,000
I just realized

410
00:20:55,519 --> 00:20:57,079
this isn't just a simple judgment.

411
00:20:57,359 --> 00:20:58,160
Su Shi

412
00:20:58,759 --> 00:21:00,160
was imprisoned by her failed past

413
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:02,440
and her sick need
to control her daughter.

414
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:03,759
Le Tianyi

415
00:21:04,079 --> 00:21:05,200
was imprisoned by his inferiority

416
00:21:05,519 --> 00:21:07,240
and his fear of Zhang Xiaodong.

417
00:21:07,519 --> 00:21:08,799
Wang Xuan and Su Tang,

418
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:10,559
one suffered domestic abuse,

419
00:21:10,559 --> 00:21:11,839
the other psychological control.

420
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,559
They each had their own struggles.

421
00:21:14,759 --> 00:21:15,559
Shiyu,

422
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,240
what do you think?

423
00:21:27,359 --> 00:21:28,160
Understood.

424
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:31,680
I've been looking at it all wrong.

425
00:21:33,799 --> 00:21:34,839
I always thought

426
00:21:35,599 --> 00:21:37,279
the killer was punishing them
for their sins.

427
00:21:38,519 --> 00:21:39,640
But that's not true.

428
00:21:40,119 --> 00:21:41,599
It wasn't simply about revenge.

429
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,559
She wanted to show us, in her own way,

430
00:21:44,759 --> 00:21:45,559
that these people

431
00:21:46,119 --> 00:21:48,160
all died in the cages
they built themselves.

432
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:49,400
So you're saying

433
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:52,200
the killer thought
they all brought it on themselves?

434
00:22:10,559 --> 00:22:11,400
I'll ask around.

435
00:22:17,079 --> 00:22:18,440
(The gardener)

436
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:20,200
(who buried secrets in his courtyard)

437
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:21,880
(will finally give his garden)

438
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:23,799
(one last sacrifice.)

439
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:25,400
(He once grew)

440
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:28,279
(the brightest blooms of charity
with lies,)

441
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:29,720
(and fed the roots of his family)

442
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:31,279
(with the bones of young girls.)

443
00:22:31,920 --> 00:22:32,720
(Now,)

444
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,559
(his rotting body)

445
00:22:34,559 --> 00:22:36,720
(will nourish another sea of flowers.)

446
00:22:37,359 --> 00:22:38,160
(Go and see.)

447
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:40,880
(See those eyes
that once looked to you,)

448
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:42,480
(helpless and unable to beg.)

449
00:22:42,960 --> 00:22:43,920
I talked to the store owner.

450
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:45,279
He didn't see anyone suspicious.

451
00:22:45,279 --> 00:22:46,720
And there's no camera coverage here.

452
00:22:55,900 --> 00:23:01,146
(Weiyou Mart)

453
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:02,640
Welcome.

454
00:23:22,220 --> 00:23:25,760
♪My scalpel cuts through
ten years of mist♪

455
00:23:26,280 --> 00:23:29,580
♪Every silence repeats what we missed♪

456
00:23:30,620 --> 00:23:35,173
♪That rainy night,
fireworks lit your face♪

457
00:23:37,320 --> 00:23:41,180
♪I chased that bus, but lost the race♪

458
00:23:41,180 --> 00:23:45,200
♪I chased that bus, but lost the race♪

459
00:23:45,620 --> 00:23:49,506
♪I write a letter
in the whispering wind♪

460
00:23:49,860 --> 00:23:53,560
♪Send it to the rooftop
of our seventeen♪

461
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:57,440
♪You said snowflakes
could summon storms♪

462
00:23:57,720 --> 00:24:03,050
♪Those cries of your name
tremble with fear♪

463
00:24:03,220 --> 00:24:07,280
♪The sunflower fields are empty now♪

464
00:24:07,386 --> 00:24:10,200
♪The wind still lingers somehow♪

465
00:24:10,600 --> 00:24:15,760
♪Just to hear those words again♪

466
00:24:16,986 --> 00:24:21,400
♪I love you♪

467
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:33,953
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

468
00:24:34,510 --> 00:24:38,660
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

469
00:24:38,833 --> 00:24:42,510
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

470
00:24:43,180 --> 00:24:47,086
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

471
00:24:56,126 --> 00:24:59,800
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

472
00:25:00,140 --> 00:25:02,520
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

473
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:07,260
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

474
00:25:07,326 --> 00:25:11,080
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

475
00:25:11,406 --> 00:25:15,680
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

476
00:25:16,100 --> 00:25:20,060
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

477
00:25:21,153 --> 00:25:24,340
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

478
00:25:25,113 --> 00:25:29,000
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

479
00:25:37,990 --> 00:25:41,780
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

480
00:25:42,193 --> 00:25:46,070
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

481
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:49,980
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

482
00:25:50,140 --> 00:25:52,990
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

483
00:25:53,046 --> 00:25:57,710
♪Tonight, I don't care...♪
